          'Validate the following vector index for completeness and quality. Report any issues:\n\n<index>\n{\n    "categories": [\n        {\n            "id": "financial_performance",\n            "label": "Financial Performance",\n            "items": [\n                {\n                    "id": "item_1",\n                    "text": "Q4 2025 business report executive summary: The company achieved 15% year-over-year revenue growth to $4.2B, with operating margin rising to 28%. Improvements in marketing efficiency reduced customer acquisition costs by 12%. The company expanded into Southeast Asia, Eastern Europe, and South America.",\n                    "metadata": {\n                        "period": "Q4 2025",\n                        "type": "executive_summary",\n                        "topics": [\n                            "revenue_growth",\n                            "operating_margin",\n                            "marketing_efficiency",\n                            "geographic_expansion"\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            "id": "key_performance_metrics",\n            "label": "Key Performance Metrics",\n            "items": [\n                {\n                    "id": "item_2",\n                    "text": "Q4 2025 key performance metrics: Active users grew 22% to 45 million, monthly recurring revenue reached $350M, and net promoter score improved from 62 to 71. The workforce expanded to 8,500 employees across 12 global offices, with R&D spending at $840M (20% of revenue).",\n                    "metadata": {\n                        "period": "Q4 2025",\n                        "type": "kpi_report",\n                        "topics": [\n                            "active_users",\n                            "monthly_recurring_revenue",\n                            "net_promoter_score",\n                            "workforce",\n                            "r_and_d_spending"\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            "id": "business_outlook",\n            "label": "Business Outlook",\n            "items": [\n                {\n                    "id": "item_3",\n                    "text": "Q1 2026 business outlook: Revenue is projected between $4.4B and $4.6B. Strategic priorities include launching an AI-powered analytics platform, growing the partner ecosystem, and obtaining SOC 2 Type II certification across all cloud products.",\n                    "metadata": {\n                        "period": "Q1 2026",\n                        "type": "outlook",\n                        "topics": [\n                            "revenue_projection",\n                            "ai_analytics_platform",\n                            "partner_ecosystem",\n                            "soc2_certification"\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ],\n    "cross_references": [\n        {\n            "from": "item_1",\n            "to": "item_2",\n            "relation": "same_period",\n            "description": "Both items cover Q4 2025 performance, with item_1 focusing on financials and item_2 on operational KPIs."\n        },\n        {\n            "from": "item_1",\n            "to": "item_3",\n            "relation": "sequential_period",\n            "description": "item_1 reports Q4 2025 revenue ($4.2B); item_3 projects Q1 2026 revenue ($4.4B\\u2013$4.6B), showing forward growth trajectory."\n        },\n        {\n            "from": "item_2",\n            "to": "item_3",\n            "relation": "strategic_continuity",\n            "description": "item_2 reports R&D spending at $840M (20% of revenue) in Q4 2025; item_3 outlines strategic priorities including AI platform launch, reflecting R&D investment outcomes."\n        }\n    ]\n}\n</index>',
        structuring_path: "text",
